# /etc/fstab of the PAX images that carry a disk (px63, R-px63-1): read
# by the kernel before the first program (kernel/fstab). The disk, when
# QEMU is given one (-drive ... -device virtio-blk-pci), is /home;
# without it /home stays the in-memory tree's. Write-back by default
# (R-px63-3): `sync` in the options writes every change through.
/dev/vda	/home	ext2	defaults	0	2
